      hint: "Knowing that something exists is not the same as having permission.",
      steps: [
        "Recognise that the resource name identifies what the user wants.",
        "Identify access control as the mechanism that checks permissions.",
        "Explain that the user must satisfy the applicable access rules."
      ],
