    steps: "1. UTP has no additional metallic shield around the pairs. 2. STP includes shielding. 3. Shielding is intended to reduce interference when appropriately designed and installed.",
    ans: "UTP lacks additional metallic shielding, while STP includes shielding designed to reduce interference.",
