    steps: "1. Write a meaningful subject. 2. Use a respectful greeting. 3. Explain the issue clearly and politely. 4. Check spelling, recipient and attachments.",
    ans: "Examples include using a clear subject, greeting the teacher respectfully, writing a polite and relevant message, and checking the recipient and attachments before sending.",
